    "steps": [
     "This timesheet tracks all direct care services you provide throughout the month. Each row represents one service entry (a visit or shift with a client).",
     "Use the interactive timesheet grid below to record each service entry. For each row, enter:",
     "Tips:",
     "Before submitting:",
     "⚠️ Important: This timesheet is DUE TO REAL CARE, INC. BY THE 22nd OF EACH MONTH",
     "DSP Name: Enter your full name as the Direct Support Professional or provider.",
     "Month of: Enter the month and year you are reporting (e.g., \"December 2025\").",
     "Date: The date of service (day of month, 1-31)",
     "Client Initials: The initials of the client you served",
     "Service Type: Type of service provided (e.g., \"PRS\", \"DSP\", \"SCC\", \"MSP\")",
     "Time In: When you started service (e.g., \"9:00 AM\")",
     "Time Out: When you ended service (e.g., \"2:00 PM\")",
     "Total Hours: This will auto-calculate based on Time In and Time Out",
     "# of Trips: Number of transportation trips provided (if applicable)"
    ]
